      "source_xml_line": 136,
      "string_id": "borov_ask_document_9",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "We are quits for now, then... My boys will leave you be while you exit. Don't try coming back again though, they'll be weapons free next time they see you, he-heh...",
